				1928,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Wind): Standardize casing and formatting in architecture description\n\nRefine the README.md documentation to enforce consistent PascalCase naming for architectural terms (`Workbench`, `Chromium`, `IPC`, `Tauri`) and improve line wrapping in the core description paragraph. The narrative clarifies how Wind replaces the untyped Electron JSON serialization layer with typed Tauri commands routed to Rust handlers in Mountain.\n\nThis ensures the documentation strictly adheres to the project's PascalCase naming conventions and maintains readability.",
			"SHA": "aa308504793f2b8ba94347297735009f03cb1cf5"
		},
