				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1926,
				27
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Standardize formatting and regenerate bridge shapes\n\nApply consistent code formatting across the ESBuild configuration tree and refresh generated service bridge definitions to match upstream changes.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Reformatted `Configuration/ESBuild/` files (`BaseConfig`, `TargetConfig`, `CompileConfig`, constants) to adhere to project style guidelines (indentation, line breaks, export sorting).\n- Updated import order and syntax in `Configuration/ESBuild/Wind.js` and `index.js`.\n- Regenerated `*BridgeShapeGenerated.ts` files for all Workbench and User Settings services. Complex `Pick` type definitions are now expanded over multiple lines for improved readability.\n- Corrected the Wind README URL in `Documentation/VscodeIntegration.md`.\n\nThis ensures the build configuration remains maintainable and the UI service layer accurately reflects the current state of the VS Code integration interfaces.",
			"SHA": "ef9732d3ee33ee071202d1e4afa497c176995db2"
