			"Message": "refactor(Wind): Refresh upstream service interfaces and command catalog\n\nRegenerate all interface definitions in `Source/Effect/Generated` and update `CommandCatalog.ts` to reflect the latest upstream VS Code changes.\n\nKey updates include:\n- Re-indexing source line numbers and file paths across all service interfaces (e.g., `IAgentHostService`, `IChatSessionsService`) due to upstream refactoring.\n- Adding new generated interfaces: `IAgentHostUntitledProvisionalSessionService` and `ISSHRelayClientFactory`.\n- Updating `IToolResultCompressor` with the new `registerCache` method.\n- Correcting the `TierRemoteProcedureCallValue` type string from \"GRPC\" to \"gRPC\" to match architectural naming standards.\n- Synchronizing `CommandCatalog` totals and command identifiers to match the current `Dependency` state.\n\nThis ensures the Wind service layer accurately mirrors the upstream contribution registry and interface contracts.",
